{"hymn":"FR229","parent":"E233","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Oh ! quel miracle ! Mon Seigneur","subtitle":"","syl":{"n1":"Oh!","n2":"quel","n3":["mi","i"],"n4":["ra","m"],"n5":["cle!","t"],"n6":"Mon","n7":["Sei","i"],"n8":["gneur,","t"],"n9":"Que","n10":"l’homme","n11":"et","n12":["Di","i"],"n14":["eu","t"],"n16":"sont","n17":"vraiment","n18":"un;","n19":"Je","n20":"suis","n21":"en","n22":"Toi,","n23":"Tu","n24":"es","n26":"en","n28":"moi:","n29":"Ce","n30":"grand","n31":["mys","i"],"n32":["tère","t"],"n33":"est","n34":["ré","i"],"n35":["vé","m"],"n36":["lé!","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Grâce à Ton corps livré pour moi,","Je prends part à Toi maintenant ;","Seigneur, Ton sang précieux coula,","De mes péchés me libéra."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["En résurrection Tu changeas","De forme, devenant l’Esprit ;","De Tes richesses rassasié,","De Toi je serai saturé."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Quand ces symboles nous voyons","Nous discernons Ton grand amour,","Te rendons grâces pour Ton plan","Et Tes souffrances contemplons."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Nous prenons part au pain, au vin,","Vers Ta douceur Tu nous conduits.","En esprit nous Te recevons,","Nos esprits sont de Toi nourris."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["Boire et manger plus en esprit","Est notre plus ardent désir,","Qu’en saturant notre être entier,","Tu obtiennes un vrai souvenir."]}]}